{"id":"p1m1","name":"Payment status","lang":"pyspark","entry":"solve","params":["spark","payments_df"],"limit_s":30,"ordered":false,"desc":"<p>You are given <code>payments_df</code> with the columns <code>payment_id</code> (string) and <code>amount</code> (double, can be null).</p>\n<p>Return the same DataFrame with one more column <code>status</code>:</p>\n<ul><li><code>\"unknown\"</code> if <code>amount</code> is null;</li><li><code>\"refund\"</code> if <code>amount</code> is negative;</li><li><code>\"free\"</code> if <code>amount</code> is exactly <code>0</code>;</li><li><code>\"paid\"</code> otherwise.</li></ul>\n<p>The output columns are <code>payment_id</code>, <code>amount</code>, <code>status</code>. Row order does not matter.</p>\n<h4>Example</h4><p><code>payments_df</code>:</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>payment_id</th><th>amount</th></tr><tr><td>P1</td><td>120.0</td></tr><tr><td>P2</td><td>-15.5</td></tr><tr><td>P3</td><td>0.0</td></tr><tr><td>P4</td><td>null</td></tr></table></div><p>the output should be</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>payment_id</th><th>amount</th><th>status</th></tr><tr><td>P1</td><td>120.0</td><td>paid</td></tr><tr><td>P2</td><td>-15.5</td><td>refund</td></tr><tr><td>P3</td><td>0.0</td><td>free</td></tr><tr><td>P4</td><td>null</td><td>unknown</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"lim\"><b>[execution time limit]</b> 30 seconds (pyspark)<br><b>[memory limit]</b> 2 GB</div>","starter":"from pyspark.sql import SparkSession, DataFrame, functions as F\n\n\ndef solve(spark: SparkSession, payments_df: DataFrame) -> DataFrame:\n    # write your code here\n    return payments_df\n","hints":["Un null ne passe aucun when. Si tu ne le traites pas en premier, il tombe dans otherwise.","Enchaîne : F.when(cond1, v1).when(cond2, v2).otherwise(v3). Le premier when vrai gagne."],"summary_fr":"Ajoute une colonne status : unknown si amount est null, refund si négatif, free si 0, sinon paid. L'ordre des lignes ne compte pas.","tags":["when / otherwise","null"],"minutes":5,"source":"Kata Lab","files":null,"visible":[{"input":{"payments_df":{"__df__":{"schema":"payment_id STRING, amount DOUBLE","rows":[["P1",120.0],["P2",-15.5],["P3",0.0],["P4",null]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["payment_id","amount","status"],"rows":[["P1",120.0,"paid"],["P2",-15.5,"refund"],["P3",0.0,"free"],["P4",null,"unknown"]]}},{"input":{"payments_df":{"__df__":{"schema":"payment_id STRING, amount DOUBLE","rows":[["A",0.01],["B",-0.01]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["payment_id","amount","status"],"rows":[["A",0.01,"paid"],["B",-0.01,"refund"]]}}],"hidden_n":5,"hidden":"","solution":""}